'''Afterbirth †''' is an expansion to ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth]]'' that was released on January 3, 2017 and costs $9.99.

''For a list of the pre-release blog posts, see [[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth † (Pre-Release)]].''

Nicalis, the game's publisher, also created mod tools for easier creation of community mods with the release. They occasionally released updates to Afterbirth † that incorporated certain high-quality and popular mods. These updates are known as [[Booster Pack]]s.

= Features =
* 111 new [[item]]s, 38 new [[trinket]]s, and 22 new [[pickup]]s.
* New [[The Void|final chapter]] with [[Delirium|boss]], new [[Ultra Greedier|boss]] exclusive to [[Greedier Mode]] and 2 [[ending 19|endings]].
* 2 new [[#characters|playable characters]].
* [[Greedier mode]], the [[Hard mode]] equivalent to [[Greed Mode]].
* 5 new [[#challenges|challenges]].
* 127 new [[#achievements|achievements]].
* 5 [[Modding Tools#Official Tools|modding tools]].
* 1500+ new rooms, including a few exceptionally rare ones.
* New [[victory lap]] feature.
* [[Bestiary]] that attempts to track the amount of times you have encountered, killed, and been killed by specific enemies.
* 4 new [[#transformations|transformations]].
* 5 [[Booster Packs|content updates]] that feature fan-made mods added officially into the game, along with additional original content.
* 6 new bosses and new champion forms for existing bosses.
* 20 new [[#monsters|enemies]] and 4 new champion forms.
* 2 new cutscenes and 4 music tracks.

